MyoSuite (Apache License 2.0), sb3-contrib (MIT), Gymnasium (MIT), Shimmy (MIT)
and MuJoCo (Apache License 2.0) are used as unmodified runtime dependencies and
are not redistributed as part of this repository.

`src/envs/kinesis.py` loads musculoskeletal models from `data/kinesis/xml/`.
Those models are not redistributed here; they originate from myo_sim
(https://github.com/MyoHub/myo_sim) and Kinesis
(https://github.com/amathislab/Kinesis) and must be obtained separately under
the Apache License 2.0.


